<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000000/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000000/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000000/>;
    dc:modified '2015-07-22T10:29:55'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'help text - parameters'@en ;
    skos:definition '''{"node": {"p": [
    "Restrict your search to series containing particular types of parameter.",
    {
        "strong": "narrow button",
        "content": [
            "Click to select a single entry from a list.  Use Control+click or Shift+click to select additional entries as appropriate. You may also use Control+click to deselect.  Once you have chosen from a list press the appropriate",
            ". This will restrict the choices available in the other lists."
        ]
    },
    {
        "strong": "include unknown",
        "content": [
            "Not all series have their parameters assigned. Should you wish to add series where the parameters are unknown to your selection then click the",
            "box."
        ]
    },
    {
        "strong": [
            "completed your selection",
            "update button"
        ],
        "content": [
            "Once you have",
            "use the",
            "to submit your search criteria."
        ]
    },
    "The default is to match any series irrespective of its parameter discipline, category or group.",
    "You may revisit this section and amend your criteria at any time. To allow you to reuse your previous choices, we have provided a history of your last three selections. Display your earlier choices by hovering over the link(s). To update the form with a saved selection, click on the appropriate link."
]}}'''@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:GBX::HE000000'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000001/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000001/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000001/>;
    dc:modified '2015-07-22T10:29:55'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'help text - geographic area'@en ;
    skos:definition '''{"node": {"p": [
    "Use the interactive map to define your geographic area of interest. Alternatively, type the coordinates of the required area in the form below the map. The area displayed as yellow defines the geographic limits for your current criteria. Your selection must be within this area. Help information for the interactive map is provided via its toolbar.",
    {
        "strong": [
            "happy with your selection",
            "update button"
        ],
        "content": [
            "Once you are",
            "use the",
            "to submit your search criteria."
        ]
    },
    "The default is to match any series irrespective of its geographic area.",
    "You may revisit this section and amend your criteria at any time. To allow you to reuse your previous choices, we have provided a history of your last three selections. Display your earlier choices by hovering over the link(s). To update the form with a saved selection, click on the appropriate link."
]}}'''@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:GBX::HE000001'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000002/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000002/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000002/>;
    dc:modified '2015-07-22T10:29:55'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'help text - deployment date'@en ;
    skos:definition '''{"node": {
    "p": [
        "Refine your search to select series deployed between specified dates.",
        "Use the \\"pull-down\\" menus (yyyy mm dd) to select specific dates. Your selection must be within the allowed range.",
        "If you are interested in a particular time of the year, you can use the recurring date option to locate deployments at that time in several years. To select all series which were deployed during the months of, for example, January and February in the years 2001 to 2006, enter the ranges required in the start and end date fields and check the recurring date box. This will only return series deployed during January or February in the year 2001, 2002 ....2006.",
        {
            "strong": [
                "happy with your selection",
                "update button"
            ],
            "content": [
                "Once you are",
                "use the",
                "to submit your search criteria."
            ]
        },
        "The default will match any series irrespective of its start/end date.",
        "You may revisit this section and amend your criteria at any time. To allow you to reuse your previous choices, we have provided a history of your last three selections. Display your earlier choices by hovering over the link(s). To update the form with a saved selection, click on the appropriate link."
    ],
    "ul": {"li": [
        "If you select a start date and an end date then all series deployed between your start and end dates are returned.",
        "If you only select a start date then all series deployed after your start date are returned.",
        "If you only select an end date then all series deployed before your end date are returned."
    ]}
}}'''@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:GBX::HE000002'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000003/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000003/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000003/>;
    dc:modified '2015-07-22T10:29:55'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel ''^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'help text - water depth'@en ;
    skos:definition '''{"node": {
    "p": [
        "Restrict your search to series collected in a specified range of water depth (the distance between sea surface and sea bed - not to be confused with the depth at which measurements were made). Enter a minimum and/or a maximum value. The minimum should be less than the maximum and only real numbers within the allowed range are accepted. Do not enter negative values.",
        {
            "strong": "include unknown",
            "content": [
                "Not all series have a water depth value assigned. Should you wish to add series with water depth set absent to your selection then click the",
                "box."
            ]
        },
        {
            "strong": [
                "completed your selection",
                "update button"
            ],
            "content": [
                "Once you have",
                "use the",
                "to submit your search criteria."
            ]
        },
        "The default is to match any series irrespective of its water depth.",
        "You may revisit this section and amend your criteria at any time. To allow you to reuse your previous choices, we have provided a history of your last three selections. Display your earlier choices by hovering over the link(s). To update the form with a saved selection, click on the appropriate link."
    ],
    "ul": {"li": [
        "If you insert a minimum and maximum value then all series with a water depth between your minimum and maximum values are returned.",
        "If you insert a minimum value only then all series with a water depth equal to or more than your specified value are returned.",
        "If you insert a maximum value only then all series with a water depth less than or equal to your specified value are returned."
    ]}
}}'''@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:GBX::HE000003'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000005/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000005/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/GBX/current/HE000005/>;
